{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测macOS经隐藏plist文件名持久化。对应需求：持久化。官方：Persistence via a Hidden Plist Filename。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.file-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】macOS经隐藏plist文件名持久化","references":["https://www.welivesecurity.com/2022/07/19/i-see-what-you-did-there-look-cloudmensis-macos-spyware/","https://developer.apple.com/library/archive/documentation/MacOSX/Conceptual/BPSystemStartup/Chapters/CreatingLaunchdJobs.html"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"e3f5a566-df31-40cc-987c-24bc4bb94ba5","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: macOS","主题: 持久化","来源: 默认","对应需求: 持久化"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nmacOS经隐藏plist文件名持久化\n\n### 为何重要\n在重启或登录后保持立足点\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","query":"file where host.os.type == \"macos\" and event.type != \"deletion\" and\n  file.path like~ (\n    \"/System/Library/LaunchAgents/.*.plist\",\n    \"/Library/LaunchAgents/.*.plist\",\n    \"/Users/*/Library/LaunchAgents/.*.plist\",\n    \"/System/Library/LaunchDaemons/.*.plist\",\n    \"/Library/LaunchDaemons/.*.plist\"\n  ) and\n  not (file.name like \".chef-com*.plist\" and process.executable like \"/opt/chef/embedded/bin/ruby\") and\n  not (process.executable in (\"/usr/bin/sed\", \"/bin/bash\") and file.name like \".!*!*.plist\")\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"name":"Persistence","id":"TA0003","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"},"technique":[{"name":"Boot or Logon Autostart Execution","id":"T1547","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1547/","subtechnique":[{"name":"Plist Modification","id":"T1547.011","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1547/011/"}]},{"name":"Create or Modify System Process","id":"T1543","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1543/","subtechnique":[{"name":"Launch Agent","id":"T1543.001","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1543/001/"}]}]},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"name":"Defense Evasion","id":"TA0005","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"},"technique":[{"name":"Hide Artifacts","id":"T1564","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1564/","subtechnique":[{"name":"Hidden Files and Directories","id":"T1564.001","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1564/001/"}]}]}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 macOS 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":2,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
